<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>About CabNect</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><main style="max-width:760px;margin:60px auto;padding:24px"><h1>About CabNect</h1><p>CabNect is an educational fleet-management application. Vehicle owners add vehicles, create trips and assign available drivers. Drivers view and complete their assignments.</p><p>Fares are calculated at ₹15 per owner-entered kilometre; calculated driver earnings are 60% of the fare. No actual payments are processed.</p><p>This version does not provide live GPS tracking, automatic distance calculation, document verification or customer self-booking.</p><p>Adapted from an externally sourced project supplied for learning. Original source and attribution still require verification; see PROVENANCE.md.</p><a href="/">Home</a></main></body></html>
